# Restriction checkboxes for BLZ_EssentialAuth_v1.tt (see Docs/Reference.md section 3).
# The sign-in of the Blazor app: no table and no database, only the project settings. Run it from the Essentials menu or `codegen essentials`; Auth=true ticks it.
Scope=None
Stacks=Blazor
EssentialsGroup=Auth
EssentialsDefault=false
Description=Services/AuthSession.cs, Pages/Login.razor and Components/RedirectToStart.razor: the session, the sign-in page and the guard of the Blazor app (Auth=true); needs a Jwt API (ApiAuth=true)
